# PRIVATE (미방송분): Sunrye, dangol of the ssitgim rite, 72 in 1998. White sobok, grey hair in a
# bun with a binyeo. Rite poses per cut: rules (1-06), jijeon (2-09), broom (3-07), cloth (4-07),
# salt (5-02), push (5-05), jing (5-07). Side view, faces right, 32x40.
